Package: mappingAS
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Metrics and Habitat Conversion for Extinction Risk Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lucas", "Barreira", email = "barreira_rodrigues@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a spatial analytical framework for species extinction 
    risk assessment following the IUCN Red List Criterion B guidelines. 
    Computes the Extent of Occurrence (EOO) and Area of Occupancy (AOO) 
    from occurrence data and integrates land-use and land-cover (LULC) 
    data to quantify habitat loss. The package leverages MapBiomas 
    collections to calculate the proportion of anthropic conversion 
    within range metrics. It supports both local high-resolution raster 
    processing and cloud-based computation via Google Earth Engine (GEE) 
    for large-scale assessments. An interactive 'shiny' application is 
    included to facilitate reproducible workflows in conservation planning.
